eρ递增时高精度体积递增。"},{"label":"体积精度说明","value":"高权重absolute0.75的FreeCAD默认Volume有约0.04977mm³数值积分误差；独立使用固定1e−10精度自适应GProp与解析conic积分一致到约1e−9mm³。默认值、高精度值均保留，未改几何、BOP或G0/G1门槛。此数值积分差不作为模型缺口，也不隐去。"},{"label":"原生调用与本图功能的边界","value":"同一凸棱上实际BRepFilletAPI先Add(edge)，按Contour First/Last端点赋顶R12.2768、底R16.8574后Build，得到原生圆弧基线；三格式/BOP/G0通过，未传rho。Rational/QuasiAngular只是圆的表示方式，不是rho形状控制。本机所查公开接口没有发现对应rho选项，本次不认证原生absolute/relative语义，也不泛称OCC不能构造conic。中段接触law不冒称与组合完全一致。"},{"label":"旧R1与人工核对","value":"旧两片墙输入、R1规格及工件保留在previous-r1和原batch/case34；不继承其通过为本项rho通过。新凸角、曲线饱满度与可见端部顺序仍待人工核对；其他编号和人工记录保持。"}],"execution":{"target_operation_executed":true,"convex_input_proxy":true,"explicit_rational_conic_composition_executed":true,"rho_geometry_type_depth_convexity_verified":true,"native_circular_control_executed":true,"native_rho_parameter_used":false,"native_conic_rho_support_certified":false,"relative_general_mapping_claimed":false,"source_reference_feature_verified":false,"source_exact_parameters_recovered":false,"hidden_back_closure_is_proxy":true,"scored":false,"actual_run_report":"history:outputs/manual-review/diagnostics/case34-rho/summary.json"},"baseline_execution":{"status":"success","parts":[{"label":"left_planar_support","part_number":1,"status":"success","selected_radius":1.0,"edge_indices":[4],"selection_note":"walls-1: 原两墙所有有限面直接sew；无厚度、无延伸、保留分区边。","source_feature_note":"普通圆弧截面，不传rho，不验证absolute/relative conic语义。","preprocess":{"type":"external_brep","source_labels":["left_planar_support","right_tapered_planar_support"],"description":"原两墙所有有限面直接sew；无厚度、无延伸、保留分区边。","evidence_file":"history:outputs/manual-review/diagnostics/batch/case34/preprocess/walls-1/evidence.json","input_brep":"data/original-occ/fixtures/acba6414b4b0b529cf774228a13f6190b3c8c6acbc63dae64bca599bc92aeeaf.brep","input_sha256":"acba6414b4b0b529cf774228a13f6190b3c8c6acbc63dae64bca599bc92aeeaf","evidence_sha256":"d1ed2ec739a236149a7061d761ee496244085040a3d880bdbc5ea716ca01e348","saved_brep":"data/original-occ/fixtures/f458ea